sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CE as ConversionEngine
    participant EP as EDIFParser
    participant XR as CrossRefParser
    participant PN as PstxnetParser
    participant IR as DesignIR/PageIR
    participant NU as NetNameUtils
    participant CW as ConWriter
    participant XW as XconWriter
    participant CV as PageCsvWriter
    participant CPC as CpcWriter
    participant CA as CSAWriter
    participant CT as CoordTransform
    participant SC as SymbolCssPinParser
    participant WL as WireLayoutEngine
    participant OM as OutputManager

    Note over User,OM: P0-A2 解析（已有基础）
    CE->>EP: parse(EDF)
    EP-->>IR: pages/instances/nets/wires/off_pages
    CE->>XR: parse(CrossRef CSV)
    XR-->>IR: 注入 loc_x/loc_y/value
    CE->>PN: parse(pstxnet.dat)
    PN-->>IR: 主注入 pin_connections(pin→net)

    Note over CE,OM: T02 con/xcon（设计级）
    CE->>NU: con_name()/auto_net_name()
    NU-->>CW: 网络内部名表
    CW->>IR: 收集 cells/nets/instances
    CW-->>OM: write_con_file() → <cell>.con
    XW->>IR: 复用 con 数据 + aliases/netScopes/pages
    XW-->>OM: write_xcon() → <cell>.xcon

    Note over CE,OM: T03 csv/cpc（页级）
    loop 每页
        CV->>NU: csv_display_name()/页内 netId
        CV->>CT: map_instances() → 体坐标
        CV-->>OM: write_csv_page() → pageN.csv
        CPC-->>OM: write_cpc_file() → pageN.cpc
    end

    Note over CE,OM: T04 csa 连线（页级）
    loop 每页
        CA->>CT: 实例体坐标
        CA->>SC: parse_pin_offsets(cell,section) → 引脚偏移
        CA->>CA: LASTPIN = 体坐标 + 偏移（$PN/SIG_NAME）
        CA->>WL: route(网→引脚点集) → WIRE 段 + DOT + 标签位
        WL-->>CA: WIRE 端点 == LASTPIN 坐标
        CA-->>OM: write_csa_page() → pageN.csa
    end

    Note over CE,OM: T05 验收断言
    CE-->>User: A1 con nets==590 / A2 conn==2821 / A3 instances==906
    CE-->>User: A4 csv $PN 完整 / A5 csa WIRE⊆LASTPIN / A6 con↔xcon 一致
